{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SOMETHING. IS. COMING.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something wrong at the Route 66 roadside attraction, Dalton's Dinos. <i>You should leave.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/17213bbe7fdf384664ba67235ce6c39b.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/17213bbe7fdf384664ba67235ce6c39b.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/17213bbe7fdf384664ba67235ce6c39b.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too bad your car is broken down, and the sweltering heat of the New Mexico desert has driven you into the only shelter around. It's 1992, and there are no cell phones, no rideshare services, and no one around for miles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not safe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/48773ee28c7abdafa6488b69b828ccd8.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/48773ee28c7abdafa6488b69b828ccd8.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/48773ee28c7abdafa6488b69b828ccd8.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staff is missing, and a mysterious voice on the telephone ringing in the attraction is begging you for help to find a missing child. You are not alone, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter monstrous creatures that will hunt, chase, and torment you. Take a moment to catch your breath, it may be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger lurks around every corner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/00f43410088a517420c8eee9b5ace237.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/00f43410088a517420c8eee9b5ace237.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/00f43410088a517420c8eee9b5ace237.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Mascot horror meets parkour, with a low skill floor and high skill ceiling.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As if the creepy dinosaur exhibit wasn't enough to unsettle you, you're being hunted. A creature shambles and charges toward you, forcing you to run, jump, climb, wall run, bounce, and slide through the dilapidated dino depot. There are no weapons except your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You run, or you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Voice On the Phone...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/fdb1eec410e9129a04e5f8738533f5b9.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/fdb1eec410e9129a04e5f8738533f5b9.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/fdb1eec410e9129a04e5f8738533f5b9.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shouldn\u2019t be here, but you're the only hope to find the child. Is the voice trustworthy, or is something more sinister happening here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect VHS tapes, notes, and audio logs to discover what went horribly wrong at Dalton\u2019s Dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover buried secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/d701e2cf87bc33f7d50da37a15027f25.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/d701e2cf87bc33f7d50da37a15027f25.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/d701e2cf87bc33f7d50da37a15027f25.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>From Route 66 to deep underground, the further below you go, the stranger the experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all is as it seems. Keep your wits despite a perilous descent into the unknown. Find the child, uncover the mystery, and get out with your life... maybe.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920220?t=1757457551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757457551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/4ab5b44f0dc8563364d89cb9b8354808676aa9f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757457551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/4ab5b44f0dc8563364d89cb9b8354808676aa9f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757457551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SOMETHING. IS. COMING.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something wrong at the Route 66 roadside attraction, Dalton's Dinos. <i>You should leave.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/17213bbe7fdf384664ba67235ce6c39b.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/17213bbe7fdf384664ba67235ce6c39b.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/17213bbe7fdf384664ba67235ce6c39b.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too bad your car is broken down, and the sweltering heat of the New Mexico desert has driven you into the only shelter around. It's 1992, and there are no cell phones, no rideshare services, and no one around for miles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not safe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/48773ee28c7abdafa6488b69b828ccd8.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/48773ee28c7abdafa6488b69b828ccd8.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/48773ee28c7abdafa6488b69b828ccd8.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staff is missing, and a mysterious voice on the telephone ringing in the attraction is begging you for help to find a missing child. You are not alone, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter monstrous creatures that will hunt, chase, and torment you. Take a moment to catch your breath, it may be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger lurks around every corner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/00f43410088a517420c8eee9b5ace237.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/00f43410088a517420c8eee9b5ace237.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/00f43410088a517420c8eee9b5ace237.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Mascot horror meets parkour, with a low skill floor and high skill ceiling.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As if the creepy dinosaur exhibit wasn't enough to unsettle you, you're being hunted. A creature shambles and charges toward you, forcing you to run, jump, climb, wall run, bounce, and slide through the dilapidated dino depot. There are no weapons except your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You run, or you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Voice On the Phone...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/fdb1eec410e9129a04e5f8738533f5b9.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/fdb1eec410e9129a04e5f8738533f5b9.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/fdb1eec410e9129a04e5f8738533f5b9.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shouldn\u2019t be here, but you're the only hope to find the child. Is the voice trustworthy, or is something more sinister happening here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect VHS tapes, notes, and audio logs to discover what went horribly wrong at Dalton\u2019s Dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover buried secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/d701e2cf87bc33f7d50da37a15027f25.poster.avif?t=1757457551\" width=674 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/d701e2cf87bc33f7d50da37a15027f25.webm?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/extras/d701e2cf87bc33f7d50da37a15027f25.mp4?t=1757457551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>From Route 66 to deep underground, the further below you go, the stranger the experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all is as it seems. Keep your wits despite a perilous descent into the unknown. Find the child, uncover the mystery, and get out with your life... maybe.</p>","developers":["WDR Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/68a6d18ab2f502596d7e45fe7ecd99212a5dbfa2/header.jpg?t=1757457551","is_free":false,"linux_r