hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920220/07a4fe44640441cce0727700332165a68233adb8/ss_07a4fe44640441cce0727700332165a68233adb8.600x338.jpg?t=1757457551"}],"short_description":"Terrible Lizards is a horror parkour game set against the backdrop of an old Route 66 attraction\u2026 with something dark and sinister lurking below. To escape, you\u2019ll need to move fast, navigate challenging terrain, and uncover what Dalton\u2019s Dinos is really hiding. You\u2019d better start running.","steam_appid":2920220,"support_info":{"email":"team@wdrstudios.com","url":"https://www.wdrstudios.com/contact"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.terriblelizardsgame.com/"}